{
  "name": "212. GenAI passthrough Interactions API create, flat and v1beta1 project paths (genai-interactions-passthrough) [SERIAL]",
  "description": "Interactions API creation through /genai_passthrough.\n\nGemini: POST /genai_passthrough/v1beta/interactions was refused with 403 by the passthrough inference filter, which only admitted models/*:generateContent-style paths.\n\nVertex: Google serves Interactions only at /v1beta1/projects/{p}/locations/{l}/interactions. The genai passthrough router strips /genai_passthrough/v1beta1 and the Vertex provider rebuilt the upstream URL with a hardcoded /v1, so the request reached /v1/.../interactions and Google answered 404. The router now carries the stripped version and Vertex honors v1beta1.\n\nBifrost rewrites the project and location in a Vertex passthrough path to the selected key's, so the {{vertexProject}} default needs no override; the key must hold service-account credentials (Interactions rejects API keys). get/cancel/delete of a stored interaction stay refused, so these rows only create.",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "212.1 gemini interactions create via /genai_passthrough/v1beta - genai-interactions-passthrough",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"{{genaiModel}}\",\n  \"input\": \"Reply with exactly: OK\",\n  \"store\": false\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/genai_passthrough/v1beta/interactions",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "genai_passthrough",
            "v1beta",
            "interactions"
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// The passthrough inference filter refused every /interactions path with 403",
              "// \"passthrough requires a supported inference endpoint\"; interaction creation is now admitted.",
              "// store:false keeps runs stateless: the reply carries steps (the May 2026 schema) but no id.",
              "var body = pm.response.text();",
              "pm.test('gemini interactions create: 200 - genai-interactions-passthrough', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code, 'failed: ' + body).to.eql(200);",
              "});",
              "if (pm.response.code !== 200) { return; }",
              "var j = pm.response.json() || {};",
              "var dump = JSON.stringify(j).slice(0, 400);",
              "pm.test('gemini interactions create: served by gemini - genai-interactions-passthrough', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('x-bifrost-provider'), dump).to.eql('gemini');",
              "});",
              "pm.test('gemini interactions create: completed Interaction forwarded verbatim - genai-interactions-passthrough', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(j.status, dump).to.eql('completed');",
              "  pm.expect(j.steps, dump).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;",
              "  pm.expect(j.steps.some(function (s) { return s && s.type === 'model_output'; }), dump).to.eql(true);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
